&lt;li&gt;A conscientious Producer who prioritises team health and morale&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Organized, with excellent communication skills - able to align multidisciplinary teams around upcoming targets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A highly collaborative team player&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Able to identify and communicate risks as they arise to leadership groups ready with mitigation plans&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to showcase clear goalsetting, with feasible deliverables for cross discipline teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experienced with JIRA, Confluence, Miro with comfortability in setting automations, workflows and repeatable processes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus Points:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience playing a wide variety of genres, notably in the Action RPG genre&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of UXUI pipelines&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Production experience in mobile game development&lt;/li&gt;
